  unitName: Resurrected Silvie
  unitId: 840127
  unitNumber: 8255
  description: Born from a flash of lightning and the unspent emotions of the workshop's
    elves, Silvie's first memory was of horror and urgency. Her quest to find the
    perpetrators began with a search for Nick, but it soon grew to include the activities
    of a mysterious stranger who also left the workshop of his own accord. Her travels
    gained urgency when she found out that the stranger's songs somehow made their
    listeners more placid and joyous, even in their deepest sorrow. With fleet feet
    and sharp blades, she ran onward until she finally found Nick stalking the catspaws
    who had attacked the workshop. Yet her brief reunion was interrupted by the arrival
    of the stranger, who proceeded to ensorcell the bandits with a magic tune. Thanks
    to Nick's timely intervention, they were both scooped away to a safe place where
    he determined that they were both constructs. Remembering the happy memories
    that the elves had with Nick, Silvie vowed to stand by Nick's side in his quest
    to find justice--and perhaps discover her own self along the way.
  summonDesc: I'm here!<br>I'm... Oh, where's everybody?
  fusionDesc: Whoa! Whoa whoa!<br>Triple whoa! Wow!<br>Thank you!
